  "details": "So ive been recently banned because of some vrc bug and saw you can still do a lot of stuff if banned, including:\n- password changing\n- changing your email\n- seeing friend requests\n- seeing your friends (at least for a while/with cached data, friends list array of userids is always included in the authd profile data tho)\n- seeing where you friends at (at least for a while)\n- seeing your sent moderation data\n- access the canny with cached credentials\n- access the ask platform w cached creds\n- use the subreddits\n- use the zendesk\n\nnew oauths sadly wont work so that might also just fix itself when those sessions disappear on the serverside D:",
